{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:67113d22c8c13cca31c6e6c9e51fc03d9c4b3f7e557c02ce6d98ff5d5a5040ab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f67df9cd002cfd6f5a6e7079967a627b9ea1f92c021daf3b9674683755e0b1e7",
      "text": "绝不能对有困难的家伙坐视不管！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df31bdaef8b4469def6f5f9d544835802728168c7420499644aa4d1f98e66d71",
      "text": "某天，朱雀和玄武在巡逻途中\n被外校的不良少年纠缠。为了不在现场\n起冲突而转移阵地的途中，\n朱雀和玄武所救下的“某个人物”，\n推动了两人的命运。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000013:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000013:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f67df9cd002cfd6f5a6e7079967a627b9ea1f92c021daf3b9674683755e0b1e7",
      "text": "绝不能对有困难的家伙坐视不管！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:134c13fc19a328b9106e3b797bdad4559feb69af126bbfe5b3b4862c20b46e7e",
      "text": "这边……看来没有什么异常啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17705fd25d412b3a9fb9f2b2fab5d49dd76732833d1dfa545bc1027fa13c0516",
      "text": "虽然听说有抢包贼出没\n才出来巡逻，但这一带挺太平的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bed5d1628119f2e72ddf43086f4bf4ba03b446f61a75f46bea80e9604bcc9bd",
      "text": "太平固然是好事……\n但大意不得，犯人还没落网呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccf91ea7efdc161adf249fe323fe485d69c571491649c2ecb77318709a51c3d0",
      "text": "就这样继续巡逻吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ff4eba4d3bfe5dc5ddd1a56946ba8d67225dbb3b3e3aa0560ecdc82ca8f6048",
      "text": "噢！今天一定要用狠眼神瞪住坏蛋，\n让他们不敢再干坏事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea2adc4477387fa8351a5d472c0e3e247016824ff71edd7bf5a0fc6eaf87b6e4",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c9fd4c1c1ef5f4b48d13ac951cd59ea52de96b9c27110bb708fee908af48ad1",
      "text": "喔喔，喵子也很有干劲嘛！\n好嘞，就按这个势头冲啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c1fc283cb049fa487ebb29c250b2f866407e3fb3ae8f625f6538e55a736bfac",
      "text": "喵喵喵喵——！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bb2b26b739f8a396da1c69ea1c0b8c7054df34ff2a907847a2ba9f0aca18afe",
      "text": "唔，喂，有精神是好事，\n但别往我这边扑过来啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0028a5880d149dd99796806066663ad050e392c87d299ec1d21702dc387bfb2",
      "text": "玄武对猫过敏嘛。\n不过，隔着这么远走就没问题了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99cd45d24a66009105834cb1ec914b54088b2b364072496a0a2d17d6ed8cefd1",
      "text": "喵子也别太靠近玄武哦。\n他会打喷嚏停不下来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6091933e438cb1e56cc04673779cb0b68581015041bef6f6748eafe7a5506bc7",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12d6925abd4fc0f8b167bd99f1191b64ba5b842bca92ccf1a85b9e7eabc0fca8",
      "text": "啊，玄武先生、朱雀先生！\n辛苦了，今天也在巡逻吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2074cb3038a6548888b56085bcba6d51cc52dbf76a9fab364adcaaca88f111d9",
      "text": "算吧，你们放学回家啊？\n要是看到可疑的家伙，马上来告诉我们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4da83d7becad4ede1f8e6991509c00ea7b6167074c3fe8732d6500b63f4ba427",
      "text": "恶逆无道，岂能放任\n违背道义的家伙胡作非为。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aef1b1a4a4be79377d20c076c695cf36bf71805edc0476a36438aa701622d730",
      "text": "恶行可不分大小。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be11a3d144b56fbe53396f852f714b98a4706d5b4f5944eae5bf24419f100849",
      "text": "噢！狠狠瞪过去，\n我和玄武会好好教训恶人的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e3544b49a31a64533eaa3db6748b285a38c6ac56a6068d5654fcb7c73745dec",
      "text": "太帅了！真不愧是樱绚的总长和\n他的搭档！！太崇拜你们了～！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed80a60c4ac5c18afb535c4c11f22ca02d8e770b30903ea26f24cc9307426079",
      "text": "朱雀，这附近大致都巡视过了，\n接下来去商业街……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9419171d70b4353f0f601a5128042baa4d62b5a8f1fd1ae3ec4c5ac934d1ec0e",
      "text": "哎哟哎哟，你们就是樱绚的\n“爆炎之朱雀”和“冰刃之玄武”吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f65a7ca7208b3135bd956fce1394baa3aa6df080847075547688aaedc758e7b7",
      "text": "……啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9fbf15ed09dc83d77e02bd393b538d29536ad318834d0ff459e84d90ad32904",
      "text": "你算老几啊。问别人名字前，\n先报上自己的名字才是礼貌吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b55da818aa7f3f430bb6cbdcf4d1c462d88334802edf17ac08eff97c0cd50ed",
      "text": "算了，别把事情闹大。\n这些家伙由我和朱雀来应付。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55b0e9b93fdfb1b29c6bb61312e0dd830e15714c910ad2d846b60f46357ab7b8",
      "text": "你们面生得很啊，\n找我们有什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d30917d2ca191f5757e691de848131d8d1d02c0582ebfcb6f60e2c31b3a6ad54",
      "text": "别在这装傻！你们最近一直在我们\n学校附近瞎闹腾吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e17db201bae489437475e1d11d1e7c499fe63b045c6f89f8d4ea0b6681fdea10",
      "text": "啊？你在说什么啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92b4a678880bfb5820169982ae3bed723fecef94726c5968402db6332d78d303",
      "text": "那身校服……原来如此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a69bc804e159d1bf257fc516dafeb41e3202b63b8656c15faff96bf69a8cfab7",
      "text": "之前巡逻的那一带，\n应该就是这些家伙的学校。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e394b062fc901ac8aa3bbd9682ffffef936af177e7b9c2352fc0a952748e003d",
      "text": "……这么说来，是那个吗？\n这不就是所谓的误会嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1951bd926d5dfadd9fb37fb9135e9f2a5654279d5aa7b9010567f3cdcabb0a2d",
      "text": "喂，你们几个。我们不是去闹事的，\n而是为了找可疑的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e7ef95cccb52be5b1a886a208db4509baf471a354ccd47b0e56013c8df5eddd",
      "text": "吵死了，少废话！\n总之给我出来一趟！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a30607c5a6d1b8c49ced5242e99d2f32c9e91ea9b89b5f44d7e0a2126c876797",
      "text": "真是的，完全上头了啊。\n怎么办啊，玄武？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:247af549e3eb0f505dc9f333d028d96e6d2a38dc5edcdb1f09640f5c6331cf40",
      "text": "在这里动手会给人添麻烦。\n换个地方，你们也没意见吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83a0854dc4e57e2300d8817e2d7594d35093f12425648c9ffa5e60ec3cf048f7",
      "text": "你说什么？少命令我们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4110cbce4bd0ab32497afbe5188046fb6f517bb52825139f1d6e486481cc5476",
      "text": "啊？你们几个，没听见\n玄武说的话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32f156012ef86e173e57beab38837d1049cc724879539f9b7130f79419064697",
      "text": "别急，我们随时奉陪。\n……废话少说，老实跟过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dda47402e70496df9b93a3ba26a100cca72c79e2e796e24438d9ff79971dc017",
      "text": "咕，好强的压迫感……这就是樱绚的总长吗……\n知、知道了啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11a4463da085d894dcf0fdacc41c095c89185228190926f047ede8be590c1ec4",
      "text": "玄武先生、朱雀先生！\n请让我们也一起去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dbd2d16b00f82bac4a0e06e77b4790651c6f89d51fa7f48a3a0b64ade68e42e",
      "text": "不，这里交给我和朱雀，\n你们替我们去巡逻吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:710fece3ff73e7731bc35fb7c55dd3f79a6ac7061741889044bd338c145df755",
      "text": "可、可是！\n只有两个人去应付这么多人，未免也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95340f4def78cf8971225fab380b939fa35acd5d8cb62ee9f241f57b5c6fbadf",
      "text": "没事的啦！\n那就拜托你们巡逻了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5838cac3154f89af5af16769e1036d5497c1354559b18247de4e8e450a39c13",
      "text": "喂喂，老爷爷。\n这里的台阶很陡，拄着拐杖走很吃力吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aaf6147f652ecc8abdd11312d7323e636cf6b814b327d304911a459829359ef7",
      "text": "来，趴到我的背上来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a2f6870267a0d2a8abc1380dccece94e6c7d242461ff85dc234ed2b05b9cb6f",
      "text": "哎呀，可以吗？谢谢你啊。\n年纪轻轻的，真是个好孩子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2273790f64fc6e42977b106a734dc7a49e648f98c72d228c491d209471f3a1f",
      "text": "举手之劳而已！要是还有别的什么困难，\n尽管跟我说啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10164644c32ee550c7b24999d958ab015f84a87b4cee294adf9de2fa890bc1b8",
      "text": "去车站的话不是这边，\n顺着那条路一直走到底，然后右拐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5badff7929e6808d76759a6bad946ecc719e9c462ad5bf2061d2a84e00e2feb1",
      "text": "哎呀，是这样吗？\n我还以为肯定是这条路呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:559c9bc556d3d5d56990e9c56d74b5acffbb0e67714ace26544c6fd433c27cf1",
      "text": "还特地跑来提醒我，真是谢谢你了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f91515ea991b50bed7aa651fd2f0278bc1a12fc4b02cda181cd5cb9740267db6",
      "text": "不好意思，让你们久等了！\n……哦？那边有个小孩在哇哇大哭啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ae3b00e04a7f3124af685a6a077c4a86220315222b83f4290b59389b06e4c3",
      "text": "周围……好像没有家长的身影。\n恐怕是迷路了。去搭个话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:614529d534417f1eca3f9e1e7d5c16dc267664f11087918600e658ab2a07e756",
      "text": "喂，你们几个！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_f:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a7c9556a4d0a3f93bb3ec191d36a2c8589e3a99511e0e88f21c4260002c3a8c",
      "text": "从刚才起就东游西逛的，\n你们该不会是故意的吧！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fc90334ae8d0a3f324bbe53cde77d17aa1fc54cc4adafd0b2fdb90dad838692",
      "text": "啊？怎么可能有人故意做好事帮人啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d09751a4b8390d5d1c73a7e925c8f471d13291740938c92e0f6f4f52ee8a9cae",
      "text": "恻隐之心。我们只是在\n听从自己想要救助别人的心意行事罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e6c825c050c5bdb312ef07984c47d30cd196246e2de9214e0c6d9de4ae23cd5",
      "text": "吵死了，少在那装好人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ac5ecf9dd25de4130dca09a18093368d0f6b4d81bcd801274df4c1bc779ceab",
      "text": "我可没有装什么好人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38ae65c07a4a04e8a277e29516c1e24993944beb513ddf2c2e73977d95b8e02a",
      "text": "话说回来，你们要是真想快点到，\n一起过来搭把手不就行了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb348bc9e0404de69b9d32b4b12152f45c22b914e08cfe556141c88d0ed2501b",
      "text": "喂，玄武！\n别管他们了，去那个小鬼那里！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d9e8c6f380f6254e1968e74f6b3a76cfd3eca846db964f171dc99b8575b8d5f",
      "text": "啊，喂……\n可恶，到底算怎么回事啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8967d67301d14f5b8cff720b8f8a220f126a134daf03084287c3805dc5592054",
      "text": "啊？丢东西了？\n啧，真拿你没办法。我们也帮忙找找好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71d21c5c0b03cb6785dc8ee16272cf8a31da5c0848d8a0588caee551df513eee",
      "text": "有这么多人，很快就能找到的。\n你们去那边找找！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e14c19a9b6777d813fbf8987b42197fafcb2d926599cde7e8c2ac0339900dda",
      "text": "痛痛飞走啦～！\n瞧，已经不痛了吧？对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cf1430493046501873f8fc9cee37ffed682132168cfa93b7dfb396f8a11dfd8",
      "text": "哇——！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aed1b26c599a4de32075cdda1b2510cdd85efee68d869c3064dd175f1b8f90f",
      "text": "还不是因为你们脸长得太吓人，把人家吓哭了啊！\n虽说如此，这种时候该怎么办才……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6091933e438cb1e56cc04673779cb0b68581015041bef6f6748eafe7a5506bc7",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74bafa1a0a32c4ca1b135ef02162924e38b206f8d9c0ed97ff0ee702014d251a",
      "text": "啊……是猫咪！\n那个，可以摸摸它吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a1450bcc7fcf26fc64f78bc91cf1a7f952df065896bc48fad83a99428a8f943",
      "text": "噢、噢！想摸多久就摸多久吧！\n一下子就能让人不哭，真不愧是喵子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63280698dbe951a322a853ebd981a4ea72d805144b34f91e935bc7875011ac48",
      "text": "阿嚏……好了，包扎完了。\n可别再摔倒了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:983b214f42e84e65955ad88fa8b52848d216d4701610c9936a614b0ed5de8322",
      "text": "嗯，谢谢大哥哥们！\n拜拜——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c87c12897b32d5efaaed1d3666d8aedb3525693e90efee97f0f9db17d11f1b8",
      "text": "……我说，为什么我们要干这种事啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7a41177a86edfb9fbbf53044826140af00bbbcd91801633cf3ae1487a733dea",
      "text": "谁、谁知道呢。\n不过，感觉倒也不坏……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_g:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51cf1f329bca8300909c67c85901514b3dc66b12fdc4b679768d815a51feae33",
      "text": "哇哇！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06edd50ef7479a7e64dafd961bf3a7da0766c8bf94378a8c94dc1b1fe0b072f2",
      "text": "哇噢！？杂志散了一地。\n玄武，还有你们！上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1884c6728c2e720a11a3d28916be9bdff2fcede3360127403a48db2460fe12eb",
      "text": "喂——你没事吧！？\n这散得可真够厉害的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d12205e50d2140679cafda48b5128fc769abab2eb0caff25126f52f6d795aa51",
      "text": "不好意思，好像是杂志太重了，\n塑料袋裂开了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e45aa7f46955af736363b23f3d02307acaffea28f8394b278ad102bcbb0c50ee",
      "text": "那我们去那边的店里\n要个新袋子过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6bbeef4e7c56f1526678203fd3c898489a3615d23f42c6ca41fb38c3aeaedc8",
      "text": "那些家伙……刚才明明还在说\n帮人算什么东西呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:580cf597b4b4ebd1425faa807e1f7079962bc3be5c338a0a18c924cb5243b1e6",
      "text": "有些事只有去做了才能明白。\n……不对，现在不是闲聊的时候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57ea39052bb10bd31c68389a8c6f7b7b748feaed86f592424be5357e0d3ed336",
      "text": "嗯，我们也来帮忙捡！\n嘿咻……嗯？这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_h:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17907f4b4c9c1581530d6425daf2941cd7d574e410efd993d85da5b0cf64f83d",
      "text": "怎么了，朱雀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_i:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1aed3d7662ffffed2c30d6bf1b3a5b034bc87dee362fe79c78b34d8de474d429",
      "text": "上面登了些闪闪发光的家伙啊。\n这是什么杂志啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188f77799e72f0c1563feb8d738e479108d8dcf1dbe5571ce2e062f5d95aa72d",
      "text": "是偶像杂志和电视指南杂志。\n电视指南杂志的封面上也是偶像哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afd654fbd8daf3e2133f71885cdb184dfafebc7635375ef2d9ff790af762dcf2",
      "text": "嘿，是这样啊！\n我还是第一次见到偶像杂志呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a50187f3347f9bdde30b1b3a03f8465c12e010816fb36bb16ea405ed7580dbf",
      "text": "毕竟我们不是会读这种杂志的类型嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_i:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be41a59b4bb5e5e422f304e5a93f5046698b7b0e2880658b652caafc868ac02d",
      "text": "哈哈，确实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_i:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fe7df22ad099b2b9173bbe7cda3aff238a30ab1601a34a06fdde2ffe06deb17",
      "text": "不过，这些家伙脸上的表情看起来超级开心啊。\n当偶像有那么开心吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fa0a705618f9696165b6bd76b974750d5114edc5d269e3382b7a6a45a600863",
      "text": "我怎么可能知道。\n归根结底，偶像和我们生活在不同的世界。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72b4388e229637d5eebfe43a681a5ae989f7174c3d7062fdfc4f46f4c9feea63",
      "text": "不过，都能笑成这样的话，\n肯定超级开心吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7ea8f97bf70d818c458a8e342b9c016f87d2d235e99f654f394f74dadc46cc5",
      "text": "……那个，两位对偶像有兴趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_i:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6d509ea5b51151692a20e7be51de39330472f6bbb2aaff656bf24e5a6ea1fcb",
      "text": "哈？偶像？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f8df1e8d22482f4317ee5334a15c97d7e49b095afe34f6e51f0c7bfdb1acc52",
      "text": "唔——……就算你问我是不是对偶像感兴趣，\n我也搞不太懂。玄武你呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca91c87c4fd45a8699d9af32a5efdf943c85345d4812e3607d529b4631ba1945",
      "text": "我也一样。……不对，抱歉啊。\n明明是你的东西，我还盯着看个不停。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:decfa40e920356b5516e4383261b7ad3333a00c67f87e337620a02f4bb489f30",
      "text": "好，这样就全齐了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35248327c405d263a4641d4b06c6baec3feda3a9524a9132fa50660d457bf502",
      "text": "喂，我们把袋子要来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d77e600585c372f3a3bf7c22dee6c9cee4a8e3a37c245c5fec1dbd127419e924",
      "text": "谢啦！……好嘞，差不多这样就行了。\n套了两层袋子，这下不会再破了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95f9a8c9022a569d8b16eb431c392c6b6bec1c29c25036196ad167498e541885",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n真的帮大忙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8acc2cc12df6eb4c71230fc64cfe9691a7f7a8f2c4cff885275aaf46bc9ff1a",
      "text": "那我们就先走了。……嗯？\n喂，朱雀。那边那个金头发的人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:323b649cfd8225915c92f79db130fcb2ab077ed662aeefd7a8f19f36a51049fd",
      "text": "是观光客吗？好像是语言不通，\n找不到路正犯愁呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fe2745ea8d8b54b1333a467352dc28495a05f58cce252d57e8588523190f166",
      "text": "虽说如此，我又不会讲英语……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e84742234844b4032dd9ff20ebabdb110e05185519bc5ab5b597f637ecb7e26",
      "text": "如果只是日常对话的程度，就交给我吧。\n走吧，朱雀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11e453ce741883f2640c0343ba0234a0d8e397bb0aa54dd093a6a843686f79ea",
      "text": "嘿嘿，连英语都会讲，真不愧是玄武！\n回见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d9b3c22a8cec72d3f1f0396eed707d3f4bae733b8383d100a7a2b2d2ecae30c",
      "text": "啊，那个！\n……已经走了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba6be4efaca388ab4aa525812052f7f2d78653a3ea297659346f4cc8c2b2efe3",
      "text": "朱雀先生，和玄武先生吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
